    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I find mathematics fascinating because of its logical precision—it’s like solving puzzles with clear rules. It challenges me to think critically and build problem-solving skills, which I use in economics and coding. However, its abstract nature sometimes feels overwhelming since my parents’ education levels don’t include advanced math. Still, it stays an area where curiosity drives me to learn more.",
